WEBVTT

00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:10.200
Man, I totally flunked English on our midterm...

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:11.650
Math for me...

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:13.280
History and I never did get along...

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:14.780
You think that's bad?!

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:16.890
<i>All</i> of my results were terrible!

00:00:19.190 --> 00:00:20.630
Please, cheer up everyone.

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:23.700
You got the best marks of the entire year again, right, Reika?

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:25.670
Umm... yes, but...

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.670
Again?! She's never <i>not</i> been top!

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:32.940
I'm sure you can get the marks you desire, if you invest time into your studies.

00:00:32.950 --> 00:00:35.180
If it was that easy, there wouldn't be a problem.

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:38.510
But, like... why do we even have to study, anyway?

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:40.510
You'll need to think about your future!

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:41.330
Ya think?

00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:45.930
I dunno if not bein' able to study's really gonna cause me that many problems.

00:00:45.930 --> 00:00:51.040
Yeah. Like, can we be sure we're ever going to need to know math, or science?

00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:52.590
Yeah, exactly!

00:00:52.590 --> 00:00:55.560
Why do you study so much, anyway, Reika-chan?

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:03.450
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:05.290
Smile Precure!

00:01:05.590 --> 00:01:06.190
Let's go!

00:01:06.190 --> 00:01:07.730
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:07.730 --> 00:01:08.860
All together!

00:01:09.090 --> 00:01:10.460
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:12.660
Jump to tomorrow!

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:15.370
Smile Precure!

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:20.170
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:25.610
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:01:25.980 --> 00:01:30.820
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:01:31.550 --> 00:01:36.750
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:01:37.120 --> 00:01:41.690
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:01:41.090 --> 00:01:41.660
So bright!

00:01:41.690 --> 00:01:46.860
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:01:47.230 --> 00:01:53.300
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:01:51.270 --> 00:01:53.800
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:01:54.340 --> 00:01:54.970
Let's go!

00:01:54.970 --> 00:01:57.680
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:01:57.680 --> 00:02:00.610
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:02:00.950 --> 00:02:05.420
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:02:04.780 --> 00:02:05.980
Girls! Let's go!

00:02:06.050 --> 00:02:07.650
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:07.650 --> 00:02:08.790
Everybody!

00:02:08.820 --> 00:02:10.450
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:10.450 --> 00:02:12.990
Fly to the future!

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:16.490
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:02:17.260 --> 00:02:18.660
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:02:18.660 --> 00:02:20.970
Smile Precure!

00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:33.480
3, 2, 3, 4!

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:36.110
Ready, Reika? Then let's go.

00:02:36.110 --> 00:02:37.770
Okay, Onii-sama.

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:47.840
The omelette is ready, Mom.

00:02:47.840 --> 00:02:49.740
Thank you, dear. You're a life-saver.

00:02:55.100 --> 00:02:58.320
<i>Why do you study so much, anyway, Reika-chan?</i>

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:04.760
Excuse me.

00:03:04.760 --> 00:03:07.470
May I come in, grandfather?

00:03:07.470 --> 00:03:08.560
You may.

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:13.830
I would like your advice about something.

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:21.400
I have always considered my studies a duty, one that I have pursued with great fervor.

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:26.450
But it strikes me that it has never been because of any actual desire to do so.

00:03:26.450 --> 00:03:27.870
And it's not merely my studies, either.

00:03:28.420 --> 00:03:32.650
I became deputy president on the student council because others wished me to,

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:38.020
and even joined the archery club at their insistence.

00:03:39.690 --> 00:03:41.320
Even becoming a Precure was...

00:03:41.770 --> 00:03:42.590
Pre...?

00:03:42.840 --> 00:03:44.740
Ah, excuse me.

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:48.560
It just strikes me that I've never undertaken something of my own volition.

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:55.560
And as such I'm left confused as to what I actually want to do, which path I wish to follow in life.

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:58.100
Then cast aside all that you already do.

00:03:58.100 --> 00:03:58.500
What?

00:03:58.830 --> 00:04:01.070
Stop, and allow yourself to see things as they are.

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:02.900
Stop...?

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:15.250
What's up, Reika-chan?

00:04:16.950 --> 00:04:17.420
Reika?!

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:19.840
Hey, what's up?

00:04:20.550 --> 00:04:22.390
I'm here to announce that I quit.

00:04:22.390 --> 00:04:24.230
Quit? Quit what?

00:04:24.520 --> 00:04:26.070
As deputy president of the student council.

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:28.300
The archery club.

00:04:29.880 --> 00:04:30.770
My studies.

00:04:32.520 --> 00:04:33.820
And as a Precu-

00:04:38.940 --> 00:04:40.910
It is my intention to cease these duties!

00:04:40.910 --> 00:04:42.380
B-But why?!

00:04:42.690 --> 00:04:47.190
I find myself wondering what it is I wish to do with my life...

00:04:47.190 --> 00:04:51.090
And I fear I will merely be a burden to you all if my heart is not invested in my work.

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:51.770
Which is why...

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:53.520
C-Come on, Reika!

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:55.140
You can't just drop this on us out of the blue!

00:04:55.140 --> 00:04:56.850
Let's be reasonable here, alright?

00:04:56.850 --> 00:04:57.920
President!

00:04:57.930 --> 00:05:01.100
Aoki-kun, there's no need to rush into this!

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:03.740
You're free to quit any time you want to.

00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:04.270
Right?

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:05.570
But, I...

00:05:06.250 --> 00:05:11.880
Listen, everyone. We all know how hard Reika works for us, and the responsibilities she shoulders.

00:05:12.710 --> 00:05:17.680
Maybe she's burned herself out.  So, how about we give her a break?

00:05:18.060 --> 00:05:21.050
True, she does always work very hard for the council...

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:24.590
And nobody trains harder than her at archery...

00:05:25.020 --> 00:05:29.160
Reika-chan wouldn't say something like that on a whim.

00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:31.200
Maybe she <i>should</i> take a little break.

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:31.960
That's true.

00:05:31.960 --> 00:05:32.830
Let's give her a break.

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:34.320
That settles that, then.

00:05:34.320 --> 00:05:35.750
So, Reika...

00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:39.570
Take some time to think things through. Figure out what it is you want from life.

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:42.550
I shall.

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:46.680
And I apologize for the inconvenience I have caused you.

00:05:53.380 --> 00:05:57.080
It was my idea for us to go running in the mornings, so.

00:05:57.090 --> 00:05:59.560
You do your own thing, okay?

00:05:59.560 --> 00:06:00.360
Bye!

00:06:02.570 --> 00:06:05.280
I can manage on my own for a while, dear.

00:06:05.280 --> 00:06:08.430
You spend your time however you want.

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:13.470
<i>What I want... what I want to do...</i>

00:06:14.190 --> 00:06:17.180
<i>What... do I want to do?</i>

00:06:17.550 --> 00:06:19.650
You wanna come with us after school?

00:06:19.960 --> 00:06:23.950
Yes... I'm curious what it is you choose to do in your free time.

00:06:29.310 --> 00:06:30.200
Sounds good!

00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:31.020
Yeah!

00:06:31.780 --> 00:06:32.360
Okay!

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:34.860
I'll come too-kuru!

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:54.360
Miyuki-san.

00:06:57.080 --> 00:06:59.250
S-Sorry...

00:06:59.720 --> 00:07:02.990
Is that your first time reading this story, Miyuki-san?

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:05.630
Nah. I've read it loads of times before.

00:07:05.630 --> 00:07:08.310
Then why are you reading it again?

00:07:08.310 --> 00:07:11.030
Cause it's still interesting no matter how many times I read it!

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:12.400
Here, read this.

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:17.290
See?

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:21.930
That's it!

00:07:21.930 --> 00:07:23.640
They're open!

00:07:23.640 --> 00:07:24.780
Alright!

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:26.170
Nice one!

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:29.420
Why are you still calling to your team, even when you're not playing?

00:07:29.810 --> 00:07:32.040
The most important thing in volleyball is teamwork, ya see!

00:07:32.040 --> 00:07:37.890
So cheerin' each other on, and supportin' each other helps bring us closer!

00:07:38.370 --> 00:07:40.190
Fight!

00:07:53.170 --> 00:07:54.770
What's the matter?

00:07:54.770 --> 00:07:59.300
I can't seem to get this to look as cool as I want...

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:04.280
This isn't working...

00:08:11.410 --> 00:08:12.120
Over here!

00:08:12.630 --> 00:08:15.860
It's impressive how conscientiously you watch over your siblings.

00:08:15.860 --> 00:08:18.360
I just sit here and watch them, really.

00:08:21.950 --> 00:08:22.610
Are you alright?

00:08:22.610 --> 00:08:23.480
Reika!

00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:26.780
It hurts...!

00:08:23.950 --> 00:08:26.770
Get up now, Yuuta. You're a brave boy.

00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:32.070
Well done, Yuuta! I'm proud of you!

00:08:36.250 --> 00:08:37.620
Wait for me!

00:08:38.120 --> 00:08:42.820
Reika, I'm thirsty-kuru! Use the Juice Décor for me-kuru!

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:43.420
Of course.

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:47.360
Let's Go: Juice!

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:54.800
That's yummy-kuru!

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:56.580
They amaze me, really.

00:08:56.680 --> 00:08:57.120
Kuru?

00:08:57.440 --> 00:09:01.740
They're all so passionate and devoted to what they do.

00:09:01.740 --> 00:09:03.770
And here I am, moping around...

00:09:04.280 --> 00:09:07.790
You've always been passionate about things, Reika-kuru!

00:09:09.420 --> 00:09:12.420
You're always like "Hrmmm...", thinking hard about stuff.

00:09:12.420 --> 00:09:14.580
And you're like "Hup, hup!" when you move about!

00:09:14.590 --> 00:09:17.890
You're always having fun when you're doing your best-kuru!

00:09:18.340 --> 00:09:19.140
You think so?

00:09:19.260 --> 00:09:19.840
Kuru!

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:30.510
I've compiled these reports about your previous encounters with the Precure.

00:09:30.510 --> 00:09:31.880
Make sure you read them.

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:33.120
Why-oni?

00:09:33.120 --> 00:09:37.630
Well, despite how big and strong you are, you can't seem to defeat them, can you?

00:09:37.630 --> 00:09:40.210
Perhaps you'd be better off figuring out why that is first, hmm?

00:09:40.210 --> 00:09:42.880
Pierrot-sama's starting to get rather annoyed with the situation.

00:09:42.880 --> 00:09:43.780
He's livid, in fact!

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:46.410
B-But why me...?

00:09:46.410 --> 00:09:50.960
Oh, I've already given Wolfrun-san and Majorina-san theirs, fear not.

00:09:50.960 --> 00:09:55.290
Just make sure you study them, and defeat the Precure!

00:09:55.290 --> 00:09:57.030
Adios!

00:09:57.960 --> 00:09:58.860
Study?

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:07.540
Yes, ma'am?!

00:10:10.230 --> 00:10:11.470
Oni!

00:10:13.480 --> 00:10:16.820
What do I need to study for-oni?

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:19.730
If I defeat the Precure, the problem solves itself-oni!

00:10:19.730 --> 00:10:21.920
I'm such a genius-oni!

00:10:26.390 --> 00:10:27.770
Beauty!

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:34.580
Candy!

00:10:36.420 --> 00:10:39.130
I hope Reika's not worrying about this still...

00:10:39.130 --> 00:10:43.100
Ya think it's my fault? Man, I sure hope not...

00:10:43.100 --> 00:10:46.600
She's not going to quit being a Precure forever, right?

00:10:46.600 --> 00:10:48.310
When do you think she'll rejoin us?

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:52.580
Hey, look at this!

00:10:53.140 --> 00:10:54.220
What?

00:10:54.220 --> 00:10:57.160
You know those fraction problems I couldn't do before?

00:10:57.160 --> 00:10:58.770
Hey, full marks!

00:10:58.770 --> 00:11:00.560
Nice!

00:11:00.860 --> 00:11:03.790
Why are you so happy about learning stuff-oni?!

00:11:03.800 --> 00:11:05.030
That ticks me off-oni!

00:11:05.970 --> 00:11:08.760
This world will be stained with the worst possible conclusion...

00:11:08.760 --> 00:11:11.600
...a Bad End-oni!

00:11:12.130 --> 00:11:14.840
The blank slate of your future will be clouded in darkness-oni!

00:11:19.520 --> 00:11:20.580
This again?!

00:11:21.270 --> 00:11:22.580
Over there!

00:11:24.230 --> 00:11:26.100
I sense Bad Energy-kuru!

00:11:26.660 --> 00:11:28.370
I've gotta go help-kuru!

00:11:29.380 --> 00:11:32.890
<i>Take some time to think things through. Figure out what it is you want from life.</i>

00:11:32.890 --> 00:11:34.210
Kuru...!

00:11:34.830 --> 00:11:37.590
I... I want...

00:11:37.900 --> 00:11:39.900
I don't wanna study...

00:11:41.650 --> 00:11:48.710
The Bad Energy we gather from the humans will resurrect the Emperor of Darkness, Pierrot-sama, oni!

00:11:55.260 --> 00:11:57.550
Today, you meet your match, Precure-oni!

00:11:57.550 --> 00:11:59.570
I don't think so! Let's do this!

00:11:59.570 --> 00:11:59.980
Right!

00:12:03.760 --> 00:12:04.950
Ready?

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:08.250
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:12:08.250 --> 00:12:09.390
Go!

00:12:10.390 --> 00:12:12.110
Go, go!

00:12:12.110 --> 00:12:13.620
Let's go!

00:12:39.220 --> 00:12:42.130
The light of the future, shining bright!

00:12:43.580 --> 00:12:45.120
Cure Happy!

00:12:48.090 --> 00:12:49.930
Dazzling sun!

00:12:49.930 --> 00:12:51.760
Hot-blooded power!

00:12:52.970 --> 00:12:54.690
Cure Sunny!

00:12:57.120 --> 00:13:00.480
Rock, paper, scissors! Sparkling bright...

00:13:01.690 --> 00:13:03.480
Cure Peace!

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:08.970
Laying down the gauntlet, with courage blazing!

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:12.060
Cure March!

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:16.430
Hey, where's the other one-oni?

00:13:17.550 --> 00:13:19.560
T-The four of us are enough for you!

00:13:21.280 --> 00:13:25.770
You little brats-oni! Fine, you get a red nose to deal with today-oni!

00:13:25.770 --> 00:13:28.490
Come out, Akanbe!

00:13:31.680 --> 00:13:33.810
Akanbe!

00:13:33.810 --> 00:13:36.010
Beat them black and blue-oni!

00:13:37.720 --> 00:13:38.780
Cure Sunny!

00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:41.110
What? You wanna duel or somethin'?!

00:13:41.610 --> 00:13:43.490
Fine, bring it on!

00:13:43.680 --> 00:13:44.320
Question 1!

00:13:44.650 --> 00:13:46.020
Huh?! Question?!

00:13:46.940 --> 00:13:51.230
How would you say "My name is Cure Sunny" in English?

00:13:51.670 --> 00:13:52.190
English?!

00:13:52.190 --> 00:13:55.660
Uhhh... uhhh...!

00:13:56.420 --> 00:13:58.130
Watashi Cure Sunny!

00:13:58.930 --> 00:14:00.840
Oh man!

00:14:01.180 --> 00:14:04.340
The answer is: "My name is Cure Sunny"!

00:14:04.340 --> 00:14:06.480
Akanbe!

00:14:08.020 --> 00:14:10.550
The heck is this?! I can't move!

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:14.020
If you get the questions wrong, you get crossed out! Literally-oni!

00:14:14.360 --> 00:14:15.220
What?!

00:14:15.680 --> 00:14:16.750
Cure Peace!

00:14:18.570 --> 00:14:19.220
Alright, I can do this!

00:14:19.640 --> 00:14:20.710
Go for it, Peace!

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:21.320
I'm countin' on ya!

00:14:21.820 --> 00:14:23.140
Question 2!

00:14:23.140 --> 00:14:25.620
1 + 2 + 3 + 4 = ?

00:14:25.620 --> 00:14:28.470
Math?! Uhh, gimme a sec..

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:32.900
One, plus two, plus three...

00:14:33.960 --> 00:14:35.960
The answer is "10"!

00:14:35.960 --> 00:14:38.110
Akanbe!

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:43.230
Same thing happens if you take too long-oni!

00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:44.580
Next, Cure March!

00:14:45.670 --> 00:14:47.080
Okay, try me!

00:14:47.380 --> 00:14:48.800
Question 3!

00:14:48.800 --> 00:14:51.980
Who was the third shogun of the Tokugawa shogunate?

00:14:51.980 --> 00:14:53.760
Oh god, history!

00:14:53.760 --> 00:14:54.550
Don't let me down!

00:14:54.550 --> 00:14:55.620
March!

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:58.260
Tokugawa Ie... Ie...

00:14:58.260 --> 00:14:59.940
Ie-something!

00:14:59.940 --> 00:15:02.170
"Ie-something"?!

00:15:03.670 --> 00:15:06.470
The answer is "Tokugawa Iemitsu"!

00:15:06.470 --> 00:15:08.650
Akanbe!

00:15:10.410 --> 00:15:11.640
Cure Happy!

00:15:11.900 --> 00:15:15.480
No, please, no! I'm bad at everything!

00:15:16.880 --> 00:15:17.950
You coward-oni!

00:15:18.890 --> 00:15:20.580
I am not a coward!

00:15:21.050 --> 00:15:22.690
Fine, it's do or die!

00:15:22.700 --> 00:15:24.050
Try not to die!

00:15:24.470 --> 00:15:25.720
Question 4!

00:15:25.720 --> 00:15:29.020
Complete the following saying: "The early bird..."

00:15:29.420 --> 00:15:31.490
Oh, I know that!

00:15:31.850 --> 00:15:33.130
You can do it, Happy!

00:15:34.130 --> 00:15:36.840
The early bird...

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:38.900
...gets the bone, woof!

00:15:41.460 --> 00:15:42.970
Wait, that wasn't it?!

00:15:42.970 --> 00:15:45.210
It's the early bird gets the <i>worm</i>, doofus!

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:47.080
Oh, really? Sorry...

00:15:48.850 --> 00:15:50.050
You're finished!

00:15:50.710 --> 00:15:53.320
Akanbe!

00:15:53.320 --> 00:15:54.580
Stop right there!

00:15:54.820 --> 00:15:55.550
Akan?!

00:15:55.550 --> 00:15:56.240
Oni!?

00:16:00.130 --> 00:16:00.960
Reika-chan!

00:16:01.240 --> 00:16:02.680
You're late-oni!

00:16:02.680 --> 00:16:04.930
What's the matter, girl? Lost your way?

00:16:05.160 --> 00:16:07.430
True, maybe I have.

00:16:07.430 --> 00:16:11.050
Even now I find myself uncertain as to what I wish to do.

00:16:11.050 --> 00:16:11.570
Yet...

00:16:14.490 --> 00:16:17.610
Here I stand, of my own volition.

00:16:18.070 --> 00:16:22.040
For there is one thing I will not abide: Bestial acts that cause people to suffer!

00:16:22.670 --> 00:16:25.550
As if you can beat this Akanbe on your own!

00:16:25.550 --> 00:16:27.390
Reika, you've gotta transform-kuru!

00:16:27.680 --> 00:16:28.150
Right!

00:16:31.930 --> 00:16:33.120
Ready?

00:16:33.820 --> 00:16:36.580
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:16:36.580 --> 00:16:37.520
Go!

00:16:38.530 --> 00:16:39.940
Go, go!

00:16:40.290 --> 00:16:42.410
Let's Go: Beauty!

00:17:05.150 --> 00:17:08.730
A gentle heart as pure as the driven snow...

00:17:09.860 --> 00:17:11.500
Cure Beauty!

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:16.870
Beauty's back in action!

00:17:16.870 --> 00:17:18.830
I shall accept your challenge.

00:17:19.080 --> 00:17:22.140
Akanbe, mark her down-oni!

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:23.530
Question 1!

00:17:23.540 --> 00:17:27.680
How would you say "My name is Cure Beauty" in English?

00:17:28.250 --> 00:17:29.150
English again?!

00:17:30.310 --> 00:17:32.620
My name is Cure Beauty!

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:36.590
A-Akanbe?!

00:17:36.770 --> 00:17:38.230
Huh?! Wha-?!

00:17:38.230 --> 00:17:40.720
If we get it right, the Akanbe gets hit instead!

00:17:40.960 --> 00:17:42.460
Wha?! Really-oni?!

00:17:42.620 --> 00:17:43.930
Ya didn't know that?!

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:46.020
Akan...

00:17:46.480 --> 00:17:48.130
Question 2!

00:17:48.130 --> 00:17:50.630
1 + 2 + 3 + 4 = ?

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:52.070
10!

00:17:53.500 --> 00:17:55.770
Akanbe!

00:17:55.940 --> 00:17:57.240
How'd you add that fast-oni?!

00:17:57.760 --> 00:18:00.880
Who was the third shogun of the Tokugawa shogunate?

00:18:01.970 --> 00:18:03.350
Tokugawa Iemitsu!

00:18:04.640 --> 00:18:06.320
Akanbe!

00:18:06.950 --> 00:18:08.280
She's not top of the year for nothing!

00:18:08.280 --> 00:18:10.010
Awesome, Beauty-kuru!

00:18:10.010 --> 00:18:12.150
How do you know all the answers-oni?!

00:18:12.650 --> 00:18:15.120
Oh, there are plenty of things I don't know.

00:18:15.410 --> 00:18:16.040
Oni?!

00:18:16.440 --> 00:18:20.130
Like how your understanding of your teammates is critical to volleyball.

00:18:20.610 --> 00:18:22.100
But I learned that from Sunny.

00:18:22.980 --> 00:18:27.800
Or how every line of a drawing is a reflection of its artist's dedication and passion...

00:18:28.300 --> 00:18:29.770
But I learned that from Peace.

00:18:30.530 --> 00:18:33.740
That treating children with a stern hand can sometimes be the kindest thing you can do.

00:18:34.240 --> 00:18:35.710
I learned that from March.

00:18:36.350 --> 00:18:41.680
And that you can read a story over and over and still get something new from it each time.

00:18:42.110 --> 00:18:43.650
Which I learned from Happy.

00:18:43.830 --> 00:18:45.940
What are you even talking about-oni?!

00:18:46.380 --> 00:18:47.490
Now's our chance-oni!

00:18:47.650 --> 00:18:49.020
Akanbe, get her-oni!

00:18:49.020 --> 00:18:50.690
Akanbe!

00:18:51.070 --> 00:18:54.600
I'm still uncertain about what I want to do with my life!

00:18:56.850 --> 00:19:00.140
But through watching my friends at work, I've realized something!

00:19:00.140 --> 00:19:03.610
Studying is important, but it's not the be-all and end-all!

00:19:03.610 --> 00:19:05.110
Akanbe!

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:09.820
There's so much more I want to see, to hear, to know!

00:19:09.820 --> 00:19:12.450
Akan... be...!

00:19:13.110 --> 00:19:16.190
And from those experiences, I'll find what it is I want to do!

00:19:17.650 --> 00:19:19.150
Beauty...

00:19:19.150 --> 00:19:21.690
Oh, will you shut up already-oni?!

00:19:21.690 --> 00:19:26.860
Akanbe! Give her a real stinker of a question to answer-oni!

00:19:26.860 --> 00:19:28.250
Question 5!

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:32.940
Recite the opening lines of Takamura Koutarou's poem, "The Journey"!

00:19:33.850 --> 00:19:35.910
How's anyone supposed to know that?!

00:19:41.860 --> 00:19:43.250
Now I've got you! You're stumped!

00:19:43.610 --> 00:19:46.350
I don't have the slightest clue, myself-oni!

00:19:46.350 --> 00:19:47.950
"There exists no path in the journey of a man..."

00:19:49.850 --> 00:19:51.850
"But that which he has forged in his wake."

00:19:53.630 --> 00:19:55.320
Akanbe!

00:19:55.760 --> 00:19:57.530
She got it right-oni?!

00:19:57.750 --> 00:19:58.990
Alright!

00:19:58.990 --> 00:20:01.520
To find my purpose in life...

00:20:01.520 --> 00:20:05.080
I shall continue to learn, and experience, all it has to offer!

00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:07.170
That is the path I choose!

00:20:08.510 --> 00:20:10.770
I don't even get this and it's pissing me off-oni!

00:20:10.770 --> 00:20:11.870
Get her, Akanbe!

00:20:11.870 --> 00:20:13.510
Akanbe!

00:20:17.070 --> 00:20:18.260
Precure...

00:20:20.750 --> 00:20:22.550
Beauty...

00:20:22.930 --> 00:20:24.390
Blizzard!

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:32.380
Akanbe...

00:20:42.400 --> 00:20:46.470
Why would anyone choose to study-oni?!

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:51.810
It's the Banana Décor-kuru!

00:20:53.320 --> 00:20:56.790
We've got a nice collection now-kuru!

00:20:57.110 --> 00:20:58.500
Ain't nothin' you don't know, Reika!

00:20:58.500 --> 00:20:59.300
Don't be silly.

00:20:59.300 --> 00:21:00.580
More importantly, Akane-san.

00:21:00.580 --> 00:21:00.990
Huh?

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:06.460
I believe you have the skill to be an internationally recognized volleyball player.

00:21:08.080 --> 00:21:09.570
I think you're goin' a bit far...

00:21:10.070 --> 00:21:11.980
But if you made an effort to learn English,

00:21:11.980 --> 00:21:16.540
would that not aid your communication with foreign players?

00:21:17.630 --> 00:21:18.510
Hey, nice thinkin'!

00:21:19.010 --> 00:21:22.150
Yayoi-san, tell me. If there was a more interesting textbook for math,

00:21:22.150 --> 00:21:23.980
with striking illustrations, would you bother reading it?

00:21:23.980 --> 00:21:27.450
Yeah! That'd make it a lot more fun!

00:21:27.450 --> 00:21:31.480
I think you can understand the problems people have with math, Yayoi,

00:21:31.480 --> 00:21:33.160
and make a book like that to help them.

00:21:33.530 --> 00:21:34.620
Oh!

00:21:34.620 --> 00:21:39.860
So I could explain problems through my art, and that'd help me learn too!

00:21:40.250 --> 00:21:43.190
Nao, soccer is a sport with a rich and vibrant history.

00:21:43.190 --> 00:21:47.170
And I'm sure your siblings would be very interested if you taught them about it.

00:21:47.570 --> 00:21:48.670
True.

00:21:48.670 --> 00:21:50.900
I'm sure they'd grow to love soccer even more.

00:21:50.900 --> 00:21:51.510
And Miyuki-san...

00:21:51.510 --> 00:21:56.810
If I learn more about the world, that'll help me get even more from my stories, right?

00:21:57.240 --> 00:21:58.070
Indeed.

00:23:39.460 --> 00:23:41.900
From all four corners of the globe, N, S, W-E are Miyuki's comedy troupe!

00:23:41.900 --> 00:23:43.470
It's cause I've got such a big head!

00:23:43.470 --> 00:23:45.940
I see! I see the icy sea I see!

00:23:45.940 --> 00:23:47.910
May I ask what it is you're doing...?

00:23:47.910 --> 00:23:50.770
Practicing their stand-up routine. They're entering a contest!

00:23:50.770 --> 00:23:53.100
And FUJIWARA's gonna be makin' a guest appearance!

00:23:53.100 --> 00:23:55.110
Who is this Fujiwara person, may I ask?

00:23:55.110 --> 00:23:57.880
What?! You don't know them?!

00:23:57.880 --> 00:23:59.350
Smile Precure:

00:23:59.640 --> 00:24:02.220
{next ep title}

00:24:02.220 --> 00:24:04.530
Find your ultra happy smile!
